   },
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOS.20.5#p1-562c6c55",
     "text": "அதாவது, கொலையுண்டவனுடைய அருகிலுள்ள உறவினன்.",
     "anchor": "பழிவாங்குகிறவன்"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOS.20.6",
   "source_hash": "9d73ef51",
   "generator": {
    "name": "claude",
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5",
